(F5 T2 V5b: global_node_dof_empty -no: same model as global_node_dof_empty1;
 nodes 3 and 6 keep their input dofs. Expected node_dof 3: strains,
 stresses, kap, work and temp = input 1.5 .. 2.9 (Professional 02-08-2026
 probe f5/v5b c2_no). The velocity and displacement slots hold the GNU values:
 the GNU leaves the velocity of a node without stiffness unchanged (1.1 1.2,
 displacement 1.3+1.1 1.4+1.2), the Professional sets it to zero
 (divergence NODE-NO-STIFFNESS-VELOCITY, class B).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
materi_plasti_kappa
materi_work
condif_temperature
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 0 1
node 5 1 1
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
element_group 2 1
node_dof 3 1.1 1.2 1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7 1.8 1.9 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 2.5 2.6 2.7 2.8 2.9
node_dof 6 1.1 1.2 1.3 1.4 1.5 1.6 1.7 1.8 1.9 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 2.5 2.6 2.7 2.8 2.9
group_type 0 -materi -condif
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_condif_density 0 1.
group_condif_capacity 0 1.
group_condif_conductivity 0 1.
group_type 1 -empty
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 4 -ra -velx -vely -temp
bounda_dof 1 -ra 2 5 -ra -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
global_node_dof_empty -no
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
